# Pin handoff fixtures and data files to LF so checkouts hash identically to the
# documented SHA-256 values regardless of core.autocrlf (see VERIFICATION_REPORT.md §2).
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
